  "contract": [
    "Current CoA Spell.dbc 573071 and its description specify 20% armor reduction and 10% more magic damage taken",
    "for one minute; the description names helper 573076. An ordinary cast with Soul Infusion must apply both",
    "effects. Native SpellDamageBonusTaken for Fireball 133 must become 1100 for a 1000 base, while armor becomes",
    "80% of its baseline. An ordinary cooldown-respecting recast must refresh the debuff without stacking magic",
    "vulnerability. A triggered creature Remove Curse (475) exercises the native curse-dispel path without claiming",
    "player-session dispel coverage. Dispel and natural expiration must restore both baseline calculations and",
    "remove the helper belonging to the parent caster. Supply Soul Infusion anew for each ordinary cast because",
    "the native Reaper cost path spends it. Runic Power generation remains observed without inventing an amount.",
    "A separate ordinary Doomrend 800172 cast must generate positive Runic Power, and native maximum power",
    "must permit generation. These controls distinguish Withering Touch from unavailable resource capacity",
    "without assigning it an undocumented generation amount.",
    "Cap spell and melee hit and expertise for ordinary cast controls, including the separate weapon-strike Doomrend."
  ],
